---
// Dedicatoria.astro
---

<section
    id="dedicatoria"
    class="relative w-full pt-2 pb-10 px-8 flex justify-center isolate"
>
    <!-- DECORACIÓN VINO (izquierda) -->
    <img
        src="/imagenes/vino.webp"
        alt=""
        aria-hidden="true"
        width="420"
        height="530"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        class="absolute -bottom-4 left-0 w-32 pointer-events-none select-none z-[-1]"
    />

    <p
        id="texto-dedicatoria"
        class="font-cormorant italic text-center text-2xl leading-[1.45] max-w-xs relative z-10"
        style="color: #3B0A14;"
    >
        «Más valen dos que uno, porque obtienen más fruto de su esfuerzo. Si
        caen, el uno levanta al otro.»
        <span
            class="block not-italic font-upcil text-3xl tracking-normal mt-5 texto-oro"
        >
            Eclesiastés 4:9-10
        </span>
    </p>
</section>

<script>
    import { revelar } from "../scripts/animaciones";

    revelar(
        "#texto-dedicatoria",
        { opacity: 0, y: 32 },
        { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 1.4 },
        "#dedicatoria",
        "top 82%",
    );
</script>
